@model tahsinERP.ViewModels.JobDescEditViewModel
@* JobDesc Create va Edit uchun umumiy forma (HRM-D13). ViewBag.IsEdit = true — tahrirlash. Skriptlar: _FormScripts.cshtml *@
@{
    bool isEdit = ViewBag.IsEdit == true;
}
        <!-- Quill.js -->
        <script src="https://cdn.quilljs.com/1.3.6/quill.js"></script>
        
        <!-- mammoth.js - .docx ni HTML ga konvertatsiya qilish -->
        <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/mammoth/1.6.0/mammoth.browser.min.js"></script>
        
        <script>
        (function() {
            // jQuery yuklanishini kutish
            function waitForJQuery(callback) {
                if (typeof jQuery !== 'undefined' && typeof $ !== 'undefined') {
                    callback();
                } else {
                    setTimeout(function() {
                        waitForJQuery(callback);
                    }, 100);
                }
            }
            
            waitForJQuery(function() {
                $(document).ready(function () {
                    var quill = new Quill('#quill-editor', {
                        modules: {
                            toolbar: '#quill-toolbar'
                        },
                        theme: 'snow',
                        placeholder: 'Hujjat kontentini kiriting...'
                    });

                    // Joriy versiyani yuklash
                    $('#loadCurrentDocxBtn').on('click', function() {
                        @if (!isEdit)
                        {
                            <text>
                            loadDocxFromUrl('@Url.Action("GetTemplate", "JobDesc")');
                            </text>
                        }
                        else if (ViewBag.DocumentFileId != null)
                        {
                            <text>
                            loadDocxFromUrl('@Url.Action("DownloadFile", "JobDesc", new { fileId = ViewBag.DocumentFileId })');
                            </text>
                        }
                        else
                        {
                            <text>
                            alert('Joriy versiya fayli topilmadi');
                            </text>
                        }
                    });

                    // Word fayl yuklash
                    $('#loadDocxBtn').on('click', function() {
                        var fileInput = document.createElement('input');
                        fileInput.type = 'file';
                        fileInput.accept = '.docx';
                        fileInput.onchange = function(e) {
                            var file = e.target.files[0];
                            if (file) {
                                loadDocxFile(file);
                            }
                        };
                        fileInput.click();
                    });

                    function loadDocxFromUrl(url) {
                        $.ajax({
                            url: url,
                            type: 'GET',
                            xhrFields: {
                                responseType: 'blob'
                            },
                            success: function(blob) {
                                var reader = new FileReader();
                                reader.onload = function(e) {
                                    var arrayBuffer = e.target.result;
                                    var options = {
                                        arrayBuffer: arrayBuffer,
                                        styleMap: [
                                            "p[style-name='Heading 1'] => h1:fresh",
                                            "p[style-name='Heading 2'] => h2:fresh",
                                            "p[style-name='Heading 3'] => h3:fresh",
                                            "p[style-name='Title'] => h1.title:fresh",
                                            "r[style-name='Strong'] => strong",
                                            "p[style-name='Quote'] => blockquote:fresh",
                                            "p[style-name='Intense Quote'] => blockquote.intense:fresh",
                                            "r[style-name='Emphasis'] => em",
                                            "r[style-name='Code'] => code"
                                        ],
                                        includeDefaultStyleMap: true,
                                        convertImage: mammoth.images.imgElement(function(image) {
                                            return image.read("base64").then(function(imageBuffer) {
                                                return {
                                                    src: "data:" + image.contentType + ";base64," + imageBuffer
                                                };
                                            });
                                        })
                                    };
                                    
                                    mammoth.convertToHtml(options)
                                        .then(function(result) {
                                            var tempDiv = document.createElement('div');
                                            tempDiv.innerHTML = result.value;
                                            var delta = quill.clipboard.convert(tempDiv);
                                            quill.setContents(delta, 'silent');
                                            console.log('Joriy versiya yuklandi');
                                            alert('Joriy versiya muvaffaqiyatli yuklandi!');
                                        })
                                        .catch(function(error) {
                                            console.error('Fayl yuklashda xatolik:', error);
                                            alert('Fayl yuklashda xatolik yuz berdi');
                                        });
                                };
                                reader.readAsArrayBuffer(blob);
                            },
                            error: function(xhr, status, error) {
                                console.error('Fayl yuklashda xatolik:', error);
                                alert('Fayl yuklashda xatolik yuz berdi');
                            }
                        });
                    }

                    function loadDocxFile(file) {
                        var reader = new FileReader();
                        reader.onload = function(e) {
                            var arrayBuffer = e.target.result;
                            var options = {
                                arrayBuffer: arrayBuffer,
                                styleMap: [
                                    "p[style-name='Heading 1'] => h1:fresh",
                                    "p[style-name='Heading 2'] => h2:fresh",
                                    "p[style-name='Heading 3'] => h3:fresh",
                                    "p[style-name='Title'] => h1.title:fresh",
                                    "r[style-name='Strong'] => strong",
                                    "p[style-name='Quote'] => blockquote:fresh",
                                    "p[style-name='Intense Quote'] => blockquote.intense:fresh",
                                    "r[style-name='Emphasis'] => em",
                                    "r[style-name='Code'] => code"
                                ],
                                includeDefaultStyleMap: true,
                                convertImage: mammoth.images.imgElement(function(image) {
                                    return image.read("base64").then(function(imageBuffer) {
                                        return {
                                            src: "data:" + image.contentType + ";base64," + imageBuffer
                                        };
                                    });
                                })
                            };
                            
                            mammoth.convertToHtml(options)
                                .then(function(result) {
                                    var tempDiv = document.createElement('div');
                                    tempDiv.innerHTML = result.value;
                                    var delta = quill.clipboard.convert(tempDiv);
                                    quill.setContents(delta, 'silent');
                                    console.log('Word fayl yuklandi');
                                    alert('Word fayl muvaffaqiyatli yuklandi!');
                                })
                                .catch(function(error) {
                                    console.error('Word fayl yuklashda xatolik:', error);
                                    alert('Word fayl yuklashda xatolik yuz berdi: ' + error.message);
                                });
                        };
                        reader.readAsArrayBuffer(file);
                    }

                    // Mavjud kontentni yuklash (agar mavjud bo'lsa)
                    @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(Model.DocumentContent))
                    {
                        <text>
                        try {
                            var existingContent = @Html.Raw(new System.Web.Script.Serialization.JavaScriptSerializer().Serialize(Model.DocumentContent));
                            if (existingContent && existingContent !== '') {
                                quill.root.innerHTML = existingContent;
                                $('#documentContent').val(existingContent);
                            }
                        } catch(e) {
                            console.error('Error loading existing content:', e);
                        }
                        </text>
                    }

                    // Editor o'zgarganda HTML ni hidden fieldga saqlash
                    quill.on('text-change', function() {
                        var html = quill.root.innerHTML;
                        $('#documentContent').val(html);
                    });

                    // Form submit
                    $('#jobDescForm').on('submit', function(e) {
                        // HTML kontentni saqlash
                        var html = quill.root.innerHTML;
                        $('#documentContent').val(html);

                        if (!html || html.trim() === '' || html.trim() === '<p><br></p>') {
                            e.preventDefault();
                            alert('Iltimos, hujjat kontentini kiriting');
                            return false;
                        }

                        // Saqlash tugmasini o'chirish (double submit oldini olish)
                        $('#saveBtn').prop('disabled', true).html('<i class="bx bx-loader-alt bx-spin"></i> Saqlanmoqda...');
                    });
                });
            });
        })();
        </script>
